  "title": "Raw Vegetable Salad",
  "description": "Lots of variety and crunch in this tasty salad. Spanish peanuts, crumbled bacon, and dried cranberries mingle with fresh broccoli, cauliflower, and celery. The whole shebang is tossed with a mayonnaise, vinegar and oil dressing with a hint of sugar and grated onion.",
